下面代码依次打印什么（按行写出输出）？
```js
console.log('1 sync');
setTimeout(() => console.log('5 macro'), 0);
queueMicrotask(() => console.log('3 micro'));
Promise.resolve().then(() => console.log('4 then'));
(async () => { console.log('2 sync-async'); await null; console.log('6 after-await'); })();
console.log('7 sync-end');
```

